    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/hLAeCZaoSZTVL4WYmy8kTp8PsOjxIsKCHHroFqdd7-4.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\r\nHint:\r\n$\\mathrm{B}=(0,3), \\mathrm{B}^{\\prime}=(0,-3)$\r\n$\\mathrm{S} \\equiv(\\mathrm{ae}, 0) \\equiv\\left(5 \\times \\sqrt{1-\\frac{9}{25}}, 0\\right) \\equiv(4,0) \\quad \\therefore$ area $\\mathrm{SBS}^{\\prime} \\mathrm{B}^{\\prime}=2 \\times$ area $\\triangle \\mathrm{BSB}^{\\prime}=2 \\times \\frac{1}{2} \\times 4 \\times 6=24$ sq. unit",
